---
import { SITE } from "../../consts";
---

<section class="introduction" aria-labelledby="introduction-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Software engineer · Builder</p>

  <h1 id="introduction-heading">Hey, I’m Coffey.</h1>

  <p>
    I build software for developers and businesses, with a focus on
    communication systems, AI infrastructure, and reliable engineering.
  </p>

  <p>
    Right now, I’m building
    <a href="https://leamout.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Leamout</a>,
    a SIP-native runtime and control plane for autonomous voice agents.
    I like turning complicated problems into simple, useful products.
  </p>

  <a class="about-link" href="/about">
    More about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
  </a>
</section>

<style>
  .introduction {
    margin-bottom: 4.75rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-s);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.3rem);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    margin: 0 0 1.65rem;
  }

  p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  p a,
  .about-link {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.2s ease-out;
  }

  p a:hover,
  .about-link:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .about-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: var(--font-size-s);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
